  "honestNativeGap": "Layer 1 intentionally stops at bounded read/proposal/recording/verification evidence. Fixture, recording, loopback, and BLOCKED_ENV never claim Connected, native, or first-party status; native credentials, HTTPS, provider receipts, scan effects, finding/policy mutation, security certification, and verified adoption remain Layer-2 work."
